## The qualifications of California lemon law include

- The manufacturer has made multiple unsuccessful attempts to repair the warranty-covered defect.

- Your vehicle has been out of service for warranty-covered repairs for 30 or more total days.

- The defects were not caused by driver abuse, error, or neglect.

